---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import SectionHeading from "../ui/SectionHeading.astro";
import studioPhoto from "../../assets/about/arne-kellermann-tattoo-studio-hamburg.jpg";
---

<section id="about" class="about recessed" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <SectionHeading id="about-title">Custom Tattoos in entspannter Atmosphäre</SectionHeading>

    <div class="about_media">
        <Image
            src={studioPhoto}
            alt="Arne Kellermann in seinem Tattoo-Studio in Hamburg"
            widths={[640, 960, 1280, 1920, 2560]}
            sizes="100vw"
            loading="lazy"
        />
    </div>

    <div class="about_text">
        <p class="about_lead">
            Moin, ich bin Arne.
        </p>
        <p>
            Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consetetur sadipscing elitr, sed diam nonumy eirmod tempor invidunt ut labore et dolore magna aliquyam erat, sed diam voluptua. At vero eos et accusam et justo duo dolores et ea rebum. Stet clita kasd gubergren, no sea takimata sanctus est Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .about {
        scroll-margin-top: var(--header-height);
        padding-block-end: var(--space-3xl);
    }

    .about_lead {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
    line-height: var(--leading-tight);
    color: var(--color-heading);
    margin-block-end: var(--space-sm);
    }

    /* :global, weil das <img> von der Image-Komponente erzeugt wird */
    .about_media :global(img) {
        width: 100%;
        aspect-ratio: 3 / 1.25;
        object-fit: cover;
        object-position: center;
    }

    .about_text {
        max-width: 65ch;
        margin-inline: auto;
        margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
        padding-inline: var(--space-md);

        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: var(--space-md);
        color: var(--color-text-muted);
    }

    @media (min-width: 48rem) {
        .about_media :global(img) {
            max-height: 70svh;
            aspect-ratio: 21 / 9;
        }
    }
</style>